# Multi-Admin & Content Persistence Fix

The current system relies on `localStorage`, which is limited to a single browser. We need to fix the logic that "forgets" default services and prepare for a real-time database sync.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Multi-Admin Synchronization**: `localStorage` (current method) only works on **ONE computer**. If Admin A and Admin B are on different computers, they will **not** see each other's changes.
> To fix this, I recommend integrating **Firebase Firestore**. It is free, easy to set up, and will keep both admins and the website synced in real-time. Do you want me to proceed with a Firebase setup?

